              <p>
                Auto-refreshed at midnight: 12 Eastern zodiac animal fortunes and 12 Western star sign readings, each with lucky numbers, colors, and daily DO/DON'T tips for stream openers.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="overview-card">
              <span class="overview-icon">🛡️</span>
              <h3>Bzzk (Chzzk Stream Security Radar)</h3>
              <p>
                Real-time cross-channel intelligence network detecting high-risk malicious actors across Chzzk streams, shielding your chatroom with automatic pre-emptive restrictions.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="overview-card">
              <span class="overview-icon">🧠</span>
              <h3>Scientific MBTI & 8 Cognitive Functions Test</h3>
              <p>
                Empirical 60-item instrument with balanced reverse scoring. Dissect your 8 Jungian cognitive functions, stress loops, workplace superpowers, real-time chemistry calculator, and creator streaming persona.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="overview-card">
              <span class="overview-icon">📅</span>
              <h3>Stream Schedule Studio (Broadcast Timetable Maker)</h3>
              <p>
                Design polished stream schedules without graphic design software. Features weekly and monthly grid layouts, versatile visual themes (Neon, Retro, Travel Ticket, Pastel), and one-click Discord text formatting and local template saving.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="overview-card">
              <span class="overview-icon">🎨</span>
