              <span class="overview-icon">🎬</span>
              <h3>Stream Emoji (Multi-Frame Animated Emote Studio)</h3>
              <p>
                Create custom frame-by-frame animated emotes for Twitch, Discord, and Chzzk! Features 2–16 frame timeline, onion skinning, 1x live chat scale preview widget, and optimized looping GIF & spritesheet export.
              </p>
