      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section class="home-faq-section">
        <div class="faq-container">
          <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>Can I use ErrorLedger on stream or in monetized videos?</h3>
              <p>Yes, 100% permitted and free! You are fully allowed to broadcast our tools live on Twitch, YouTube, CHZZK, SOOP, and upload edited videos with monetization and donations enabled.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>How do I use fullscreen or focus mode?</h3>
              <p>Click the [⛶ Fullscreen] or [📺 Focus Mode] button in the top-right of any game to go borderless for clean, distraction-free play.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>Is it free? Do I need to sign up?</h3>
              <p>100% free, forever. No account, no login, no download. Open the link and it works instantly in any browser.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>Does it work on Twitch, YouTube, and CHZZK?</h3>
              <p>Yes. It runs in any standard web browser, so it works with Twitch, YouTube Live, CHZZK, SOOP, Kick, and any other platform.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-box">
              <h3>Are results fair? Can anyone manipulate them?</h3>
              <p>The Spin Wheel and Ghost Leg Ladder use cryptographically seeded PRNG with mathematical bijective mapping — fully random and tamper-proof.</p>
            </div>
